0..72 Comment "// A frame-region buffer orphaned: abandoning a task whose stack holds a"
73..147 Comment "// pending completion may hand the completion, buffer inside, to a reactor"
148..225 Comment "// that reaps it later (boats, _Notes on io-uring_, 2020). That is sound only"
226..296 Comment "// for a buffer the reactor\'s region outlives, never one living in the"
297..316 Comment "// abandoned frame."
318..357 Comment "// The ring\'s protocol and its entries."
358..364 Keyword "import"
365..366 StringLit "\""
366..404 StringLit "../../model/completion/ring-base.gandr"
404..405 StringLit "\""
406..407 Other ";"
409..480 Comment "/// A pending completion handed to a reaping peer while its frame ends."
481..559 Comment "/// Delegation admits the handover, and nothing ties the buffer to a region. A"
560..633 Comment "/// kernel handed a buffer kept in a hold\'s region is refused where it is"
634..709 Comment "/// forked, since no region bounds a forked peer (`region-ended.gandr`), so"
710..785 Comment "/// this checks until a kernel can be bounded by the buffer\'s hold (#1183),"
786..847 Comment "/// when a reaper that outlives the hold becomes the refusal."
